WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.400
The Header menu lets you change link wording, destinations, order,

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:06.525
and visibility.

00:00:06.575 --> 00:00:09.375
Hiding a link keeps it here for later.

00:00:09.425 --> 00:00:13.726
The Footer uses columns with their own headings and links.

00:00:13.776 --> 00:00:19.351
Review navigation carefully in Preview before publishing site-wide changes.
